{"links": {"self": "/works/OL257943W/editions.json?limit=20", "work": "/works/OL257943W", "next": "/works/OL257943W/editions.json?limit=20&offset=20"}, "size": 135, "entries": [{"works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "title": "Joc de Trons", "publishers": ["Debutxaca"], "publish_date": "13/04/2022", "key": "/books/OL60751857M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [15149225], "isbn_13": ["9788418196508"], "physical_dimensions": "19 x 12.6 x 2.9 centimeters", "weight": "596 grams", "series": ["Can\u00e7o de gel i foc 1"], "contributors": [{"role": "Translator", "name": "Merc\u00e8 Santaularia Campillo"}, {"role": "Translator", "name": "Esther Roig Gim\u00e9nez"}, {"role": "Translator", "name": "Anna Llisterri i Boix"}], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/cat"}], "translation_of": "A game of thrones", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Els estius s'allarguen durant d\u00e8cades. L'hivern pot durar tota la vida. I la lluita pel Tron de Ferro ha comen\u00e7at. S'est\u00e9n des del sud, on la calor engendra conspiracions, lux\u00faria i intrigues, al vast i g\u00e8lid nord, on un mur de gel de set-cents peus d'al\u00e7ada protegeix el regne de les forces de la foscor que es troben m\u00e9s enll\u00e0.\r\n\r\nEl Joc de Trons.\r\nGuanyar\u00e0s o morir\u00e0s."}, "physical_format": "Paperback", "number_of_pages": 824, "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-12-03T15:55:21.524039"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-12-03T15:59:13.971387"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "title": "A Storm of Swords", "publishers": ["Voyaer"], "publish_date": "2003", "key": "/books/OL60616966M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [15141362], "isbn_13": ["9780006479901"], "subtitle": "1: Steel and Snow", "publish_places": ["Great Britain"], "copyright_date": "2000", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "BOOK THREE, PART ONE OF A SONG OF ICE AND FIRE \r\n\r\n'Characters so venomous they could eat the Borgias' GUARDIAN \r\n\r\nBlood runs truer than oaths \r\n\r\nThe Seven Kingdoms are divided by revolt and blood feud as winter approaches like an angry beast. In the northern wastes a horde of hungry, savage people steeped in the dark magic of the wilderness is poised to invade the Kingdom of the North where Robb Stark wears his new-forged crown. And Robb's defences are ranged against the South, the land of the cunning and cruel Lannisters, who have his young sisters in their power. Throughout Westeros the war for the Iron Throne rages more fiercely than ever, but if the Wall is breached, no king will live to claim it. \r\n\r\n'Colossal, staggering... Martin captures all the intoxicating complexity of the Wars of the Roses or Imperial Rome in his imaginary world... This looks set to become one of the greats of fantasy literature.' SFX"}, "physical_format": "Paperback", "number_of_pages": 672, "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-10T21:01:04.614621"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-10T21:05:25.656529"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "title": "A Game of Thrones", "publishers": ["Voyaer"], "publish_date": "2003", "key": "/books/OL60616965M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "isbn_13": ["9780006479901"], "covers": [15141359], "latest_revision": 2, "revision": 2, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-10T20:54:59.727541"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-10T20:59:47.826264"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "title": "A Guerra dos Tronos", "publishers": ["Suma"], "publish_date": "2019", "key": "/books/OL60598935M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [15139462], "subtitle": "As Cr\u00f4nicas de Gelo e Fogo, Volume 1", "publish_places": ["Brazil"], "series": ["A Game of Thrones"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/por"}], "translation_of": "A Game of Thrones", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "description": "A guerra dos tronos \u00e9 o primeiro livro da s\u00e9rie best-seller internacional As Cr\u00f4nicas de Gelo e Fogo, que deu origem \u00e0 adapta\u00e7\u00e3o de sucesso da HBO, Game of Thrones.\r\nO ver\u00e3o pode durar d\u00e9cadas. O inverno, toda uma vida. E a guerra dos tronos come\u00e7ou. Como Guardi\u00e3o do Norte, lorde Eddard Stark n\u00e3o fica feliz quando o rei Robert o proclama a nova M\u00e3o do Rei. Sua honra o obriga a aceitar o cargo e deixar seu posto em Winterfell para rumar para a corte, onde os homens fazem o que lhes conv\u00e9m, n\u00e3o o que devem... e onde um inimigo morto \u00e9 algo a ser admirado.\r\n\r\nLonge de casa e com a fam\u00edlia dividida, Eddard se v\u00ea cada vez mais enredado nas intrigas mortais de Porto Real, sem saber que perigos ainda maiores espreitam a dist\u00e2ncia.\r\n\r\nNas florestas ao norte de Winterfell, for\u00e7as sobrenaturais se espalham por tr\u00e1s da Muralha que protege a regi\u00e3o. E, nas Cidades Livres, o jovem Rei Drag\u00e3o exilado na Rebeli\u00e3o de Robert planeja sua vingan\u00e7a e deseja recuperar sua heran\u00e7a de fam\u00edlia: o Trono de Ferro de Westeros.", "physical_format": "paperback", "number_of_pages": 592, "isbn_10": ["8556510787"], "isbn_13": ["9788556510785"], "latest_revision": 4, "revision": 4, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-06T15:21:05.714786"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-11-06T15:23:34.153866"}}, {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "title": "Taht Oyunlar\u0131", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL234664A"}], "publish_date": "Oct 17, 2019", "source_records": ["amazon:6051735755"], "number_of_pages": 832, "publishers": ["Epsilon Yay\u0131nevi"], "isbn_10": ["6051735755"], "isbn_13": ["9786051735757"], "physical_format": "hardcover", "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Source title: Taht Oyunlar\u0131 (Resimli \u00d6zel Bask\u0131)"}, "covers": [12115212], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "key": "/books/OL35304190M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2021-10-19T04:21:26.990748"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-10-05T17:54:50.047308"}}, {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "title": "Le Tr\u00f4ne de fer - L'Int\u00e9grale", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL234664A"}], "publish_date": "Nov 17, 2012", "source_records": ["amazon:2756408522"], "number_of_pages": 1184, "publishers": ["PYGMALION"], "isbn_10": ["2756408522"], "isbn_13": ["9782756408521"], "physical_format": "paperback", "full_title": "Le Tr\u00f4ne de fer - L'Int\u00e9grale : La Bataille des rois - L'Ombre mal\u00e9fique - L'Invincible Forteresse", "subtitle": "La Bataille des rois - L'Ombre mal\u00e9fique - L'Invincible Forteresse", "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Source title: Le Tr\u00f4ne de fer - L'Int\u00e9grale: La Bataille des rois - L'Ombre mal\u00e9fique - L'Invincible Forteresse (2)"}, "covers": [13871375], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "key": "/books/OL47323528M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-04-09T09:55:00.465383"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-10-05T17:10:31.178410"}}, {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "title": "Le tr\u00f4ne de fer", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL234664A"}, {"key": "/authors/OL3113904A"}], "publish_date": "Apr 08, 2015", "source_records": ["amazon:2290107093"], "number_of_pages": 1200, "publishers": ["J'AI LU"], "isbn_10": ["2290107093"], "isbn_13": ["9782290107096"], "physical_format": "paperback", "full_title": "Le tr\u00f4ne de fer L'int\u00e9grale", "subtitle": "L'int\u00e9grale", "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Source title: Le tr\u00f4ne de fer: L'int\u00e9grale (5)"}, "works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "key": "/books/OL40223116M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2022-10-29T14:46:24.997344"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-10-05T17:10:31.178410"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL257943W"}], "title": "Juego de Tronos", "publishers": ["PLAZA & JANES"], "publish_date": "1996", "key": "/books/OL60304663M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "series": ["Cancion de Hielo y Fuego"], "physical_format": "Tapa dura", "number_of_pages": 800, "covers": [15127390], "isbn_13": ["9788401032424"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "En un mundo diferente al nuestro, en el que los veranos y los inviernos duran generaciones, un gran conflicto est\u00e1 a punto de estallar. Robert Baratheon ocupa el Trono de Hierro en el c\u00e1lido y opulento sur de Poniente. Se lo arrebat\u00f3 tras una sangrienta guerra al \u00faltimo rey loco de la dinast\u00eda Targaryen, se\u00f1ores de dragones.\r\n\r\nSin embargo, ahora su poder se ve amenazado: en el norte, el Muro erigido para proteger el reino de las bestias y de los extra\u00f1os se tambalea. Hace siglos que nadie ve a los caminantes blancos, pero \u00bfqui\u00e9nes son entonces esos seres de ojos azules y fr\u00edos que se ocultan en las sombras de los bosques y que les arrebatan la vida y la mente a aquellos desafortunados que se cruzan en su camino? El final del verano est\u00e1 pr\u00f3ximo, se acerca el invierno y solo un milagro podr\u00e1 disipar las tinieblas."}, "latest_revision": 5, "revision": 5, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-09-29T12:17:30.713961"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-10-05T17:01:05.451606"}}, {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL234664A"}, {"key": "/authors/OL14414716A"}, {"key": "/authors/OL14414717A"}], "isbn_13": ["9781514256220"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/spa"}], "number_of_pag